    Paragraphs are separated by one or more blank lines in the input and
    are wrapped independently. Each paragraph's words are joined by single
    spaces and wrapped greedily. A word longer than width is placed on its
    own line without being split. Paragraphs are joined in the output by a
    single blank line.
